  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO Complementary Support to the Cambodia Programme for Sustainable and Inclusive Growth in the Fisheries Sector: Capture component (CAPFISH Capture)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The objective of this contract (project) is to build the capacity of central and subnational administrations involved in the management, conservation and control and surveillance of Cambodia&apos;s inland and marine fisheries, as well as the communities involved in the co-management of the resources and their networks&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
